#: metadata.json->name
msgid "T2 Fan (AUTO / MAX)"
msgstr "Ventilador T2 (AUTO / MAX)"

#: metadata.json->description
msgid ""
"Fan control for Intel Macs with the Apple T2 chip running Linux (t2fanrd "
"service): one click toggles AUTO and MAX, with Strong, Medium and Quiet AUTO"
" profiles and live CPU temperature and fan RPM."
msgstr ""
"Control del ventilador de los Mac Intel con chip Apple T2 en Linux (servicio"
" t2fanrd): un clic cambia entre AUTO y MAX, con perfiles AUTO Fuerte, Medio "
"y Silencioso, y temperatura de la CPU y RPM del ventilador en directo."

#: metadata.json->comments
msgid ""
"Left click: AUTO ↔ MAX.\n"
"Right click: AUTO profile, live readings and options.\n"
"\n"
"AUTO profiles:\n"
"  Strong: 40–60 °C, logarithmic curve\n"
"  Medium: 50–75 °C, linear curve\n"
"  Quiet: 60–85 °C, exponential curve\n"
"\n"
"Requires t2fanrd (t2linux project) and Cinnamon.\n"
"Tested on a Mac mini 2018 (Macmini8,1) with Cinnamon 6.6.\n"
"\n"
"Author: pepsimo — https://www.pepsimo.es\n"
"Co-author: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic)\n"
"Source code and documentation: https://github.com/pepsimo/t2fan-control\n"
"License: GPL-3.0-or-later. No warranty of any kind."
msgstr ""
"Clic izquierdo: AUTO ↔ MAX.\n"
"Clic derecho: perfil AUTO, lecturas en directo y opciones.\n"
"\n"
"Perfiles AUTO:\n"
"  Fuerte: 40–60 °C, curva logarítmica\n"
"  Medio: 50–75 °C, curva lineal\n"
"  Silencioso: 60–85 °C, curva exponencial\n"
"\n"
"Requiere t2fanrd (proyecto t2linux) y Cinnamon.\n"
"Probado en un Mac mini 2018 (Macmini8,1) con Cinnamon 6.6.\n"
"\n"
"Autor: pepsimo — https://www.pepsimo.es\n"
"Coautor: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic)\n"
"Código fuente y documentación: https://github.com/pepsimo/t2fan-control\n"
"Licencia: GPL-3.0-or-later. Sin ninguna garantía."

#: settings-schema.json->head-panel->description
msgid "In the panel"
msgstr "En la barra"

#: settings-schema.json->show-temp->description
msgid "Show the CPU temperature"
msgstr "Mostrar la temperatura de la CPU"

#: settings-schema.json->show-rpm->description
msgid "Show the fan RPM"
msgstr "Mostrar las RPM del ventilador"

#: settings-schema.json->temp-warning->description
msgid "Turn red from"
msgstr "Poner en rojo a partir de"

#: settings-schema.json->temp-warning->tooltip
msgid "The panel label turns red when the CPU reaches this temperature."
msgstr ""
"La etiqueta de la barra se pone en rojo cuando la CPU llega a esta "
"temperatura."

#: settings-schema.json->temp-warning->units
msgid "°C"
msgstr "°C"

#: settings-schema.json->head-menu->description
msgid "In the right-click menu"
msgstr "En el menú del clic derecho"

#: settings-schema.json->show-menu-readings->description
msgid "Show temperature and RPM in the menu"
msgstr "Mostrar temperatura y RPM en el menú"

#: settings-schema.json->head-readings->description
msgid "Readings"
msgstr "Lecturas"

#: settings-schema.json->refresh-interval->description
msgid "Refresh every"
msgstr "Actualizar cada"

#: settings-schema.json->refresh-interval->tooltip
msgid ""
"Each reading is two tiny /sys files, so the load is negligible. If panel "
"readings are off, sensors are only read while the menu is open."
msgstr ""
"Cada lectura son dos archivos diminutos de /sys: la carga es despreciable. "
"Si las lecturas de la barra están desactivadas, los sensores solo se leen "
"con el menú abierto."

#: settings-schema.json->refresh-interval->units
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "segundos"
